      "leftHeadline": "Black Self-Determination and Dignity",
      "leftText": "Black Power advocates argued that non-violence begged white oppressors for rights, and that Black people must defend themselves and control their own communities' destiny.",
      "rightHeadline": "Dangerous Separatism and Militancy",
      "rightText": "Mainstream civil rights leaders like MLK and white liberals warned that Black Power isolationism and armed militancy would alienate white allies and trigger a racial war.",
